{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"I’ll recreate the storefront and deploy it as a new Vercel project, using Stripe test mode and Prodigi’s sandbox for an end-to-end-safe checkout/fulfillment path. I’m using the Sites workflow for the web build and hosting guidance."}}
